{"body":"Bumps the gradle-minor-and-patch group with 1 update in the /kotlin directory: [gradle-wrapper](https://github.com/gradle/gradle).\n\nUpdates `gradle-wrapper` from 9.8.2 to 9.9.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/releases\">gradle-wrapper's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>9.9.0</h2>\n<p>The Gradle team is excited to announce Gradle 9.9.0.</p>\n<p>Here are the highlights of this release:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Performance improvements for Kotlin DSL compilation</li>\n<li>Test filtering for non-method JUnit Platform tests</li>\n<li>Wrapper settings preserved on upgrade</li>\n<li>Predefined groups in the Problems API</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.gradle.org/9.9.0/release-notes.html\">Read the Release Notes</a></p>\n<p>We would like to thank the following community members for their contributions to this release of Gradle:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/liutikas\">Aurimas</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/devareddy05\">devareddy05</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/DragonFSKY\">DragonFSKY</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fru1tworld\">fru1tworld</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/ikxeno\">Ivan Khanas</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/shoemoney\">Jeremy Schoemaker</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/wakingrufus\">John Burns</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/itsCodeTide\">Labh R Jethe</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Herudaio\">Marcin Mycek</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Develop-KIM\">monkey</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/runningcode\">Nelson Osacky</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/rpalcolea\">Roberto Perez Alcolea</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/TWiStErRob\">Róbert Papp</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/namest504\">SeungTaek Lim</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/oehme\">Stefan Oehme</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Wanbinyu\">万彬宇</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/exijn\">한의준</a>.</p>\n<h2>Upgrade instructions</h2>\n<p>Switch your build to use Gradle 9.9.0 by updating your wrapper:</p>\n<pre><code>./gradlew :wrapper --gradle-version=9.9.0 &amp;&amp; ./gradlew :wrapper\r\n</code></pre>\n<p>See the Gradle <a href=\"https://docs.gradle.org/9.9.0/userguide/upgrading_version_9.html\">9.x upgrade guide</a> to learn about deprecations, breaking changes and other considerations when upgrading.</p>\n<p>For Java, Groovy, Kotlin and Android compatibility, see the <a href=\"https://docs.gradle.org/9.9.0/userguide/compatibility.html\">full compatibility notes</a>.</p>\n<h2>Reporting problems</h2>\n<p>If you find a problem with this release, please file a bug on <a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/issues\">GitHub Issues</a> adhering to our issue guidelines.\nIf you're not sure you're encountering a bug, please use the <a href=\"https://discuss.gradle.org/c/help-discuss\">forum</a>.</p>\n<p>We hope you will build happiness with Gradle, and we look forward to your feedback via <a href=\"https://twitter.com/gradle\">Twitter</a> or on <a href=\"https://github.com/gradle\">GitHub</a>.</p>\n<h2>9.9.0 RC1</h2>\n<p>The Gradle team is excited to announce Gradle 9.9.0 RC1.</p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/dabfe84a6c2590fa6ecaab03ff6fefe5b838d558\"><code>dabfe84</code></a> Document Groovy 6.0.0 as tested upper bound (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39723\">#39723</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/122555df208baf1b91c52a61aee13c1aabb9c9a4\"><code>122555d</code></a> Document Groovy 6.0.0 as tested upper bound</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/74ee0c8d6a247ee012d963b51834b125463cb37e\"><code>74ee0c8</code></a> Update Documentation: Link Build Scan and Develocity from docs pages (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39646\">#39646</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/62c24fbf4951be67f41336205cf56e64eeccfdb8\"><code>62c24fb</code></a> Address review feedback on troubleshooting page</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/8ecd0d65f45bcc9383782e37970408372abeb2d8\"><code>8ecd0d6</code></a> Stop closing linked issues for PRs merged into release7x (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/gradle/gradle/issues/39703\">#39703</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/f2cb6caab896bd3ef51c73fcb7d6469c052b4160\"><code>f2cb6ca</code></a> Address review feedback on troubleshooting page</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/6c04b55b97ba493663bc079d3d9949b66479ee63\"><code>6c04b55</code></a> Upgrade Documentation: Mention the Security Subscription on dependency, wrapp...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/cb7f22d6d072cdd54e826ff6581b5d99d6642fb2\"><code>cb7f22d</code></a> Stop closing linked issues for PRs merged into release7x</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/8630de35a920ec53c582b1d887d3ffd15ea0bfae\"><code>8630de3</code></a> Use a task-not-found failure on troubleshooting</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/commit/1ae77017d3fa5273b70168ed333007b6d61a818c\"><code>1ae7701</code></a> Restore Extended Security Support section title</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/gradle/gradle/compare/v9.8.2...v9.9.0\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n","headRefOid":"789763deb222073b5106ba6ddfa8c86626ca09b5","mergeStateStatus":"BEHIND","number":395,"statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:49:39Z","conclusion":"FAILURE","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/link-foundation/links-notation/actions/runs/43323120607/job/131548639252","name":"latest-stable","startedAt":"2026-11-12T22:49:26Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"dependency freshness"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-11-12T22:52:59Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"htt